13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is often in the quiet, unplanned moments that we find the true heart of a community. I hope these records reveal how we truly connect.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that the human element is important, but we must also be realistic about the logistical burden. I want to see if the current setup is simply inefficient.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
