16,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just want to make sure we don't make a mistake with the budget. It feels safer to have the numbers in front of us before we decide.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I think we need to know if people are actually being fair! If we just guess, we might miss something really important about how we use the room.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us gather our facts with an open heart, for the numbers tell one story, but the spirit of our interactions tells another.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Numbers provide a baseline, but the time spent on invisible labor is what usually breaks a system. I'll be interested to see if the logistics match the sentiment.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shion,,"Let's just get to the data. I'm curious to see if the ""spirit"" Servas mentions is actually just a cover for a lack of basic cleanliness.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
