23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready to see what's going on! I hope we find a way to make it fair for everyone.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
